@startuml
skinparam {
    ActorBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
    BoundaryBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
    ControlBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
    EntityBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
    DatabaseBackgroundColor #FFFFFF

    ActorBorderColor black
    BoundaryBorderColor black
    ControlBorderColor black
    EntityBorderColor black
    DatabaseBorderColor black
}

actor User
boundary "View Replies UI" as UI
boundary Router
control ReplyController
control ReplyService
entity ReplyModel
database MongoDB

User -> UI: 1. Open comment replies
activate User
activate UI

UI -> Router: 2. GET /reply/{commentId}
activate Router

Router -> ReplyController: 3. getALlRepliesOfCommentChapter(id, req)
activate ReplyController

ReplyController -> ReplyService: 4. getRepliesForCommentChapter(commentId, payload)
activate ReplyService

ReplyService -> ReplyModel: 5. aggregate(match comment_id, is_delete=false)
activate ReplyModel
ReplyModel -> MongoDB: 6. aggregate pipeline
activate MongoDB

MongoDB --> ReplyModel: 7. replies + users + votes
deactivate MongoDB
ReplyModel --> ReplyService: 8. aggregated replies
deactivate ReplyModel

ReplyService --> ReplyController: 9. replies list
deactivate ReplyService

ReplyController --> Router: 10. HTTP response (replies)
deactivate ReplyController
Router --> UI: 11. Show replies
deactivate Router
UI --> User: 12. View replies with votes
deactivate UI
deactivate User
@enduml
